{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24041","headline":"岁暮 · 白居易","name":"岁暮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惨澹岁云暮，穷阴动经旬。\n霜风裂人面，冰雪摧车轮。\n而我当是时，独不知苦辛。\n晨炊廪有米，夕爨厨有薪。\n夹帽长覆耳，重裘宽裹身。\n加之一桮酒，煦妪如阳春。\n洛城士与庶，比屋多饥贫。\n何处炉有火，谁家甑无尘。\n如我饱煖者，百人无一人。\n安得不慙媿，放歌聊自陈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24041.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24041","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}